---
// The home page is the `pages` entry with slug `home`, and `pages` has the URL
// pattern `/{slug}`, so EmDash's preview link and the sitemap give it the URL
// /home (docs/relaunch/architecture.md, Content model). The home page lives at
// /, so /home answers with a 301 to / and keeps the query string: the preview
// link's `?_preview=` token must reach /, which reads the entry. An EmDash
// redirect cannot do this: its middleware answers with the destination only
// and drops the query (emdash 1.5.0, astro/middleware/redirect.ts).
// Not cached: a redirect is cheap to answer, and a cached one would outlive a
// change to how home is handled.
if (Astro.cache?.enabled) Astro.cache.set(false);
return Astro.redirect(`/${Astro.url.search}`, 301);
